* FSPF -- Fake SPF menu. It's just a menu...
* MAPS in this file:
*   MAINMENU        - FSPF main menu.
*   MAINMENUTICK    - Tick the clock.
*   MAINMENUHELP1   - First page of help for the FSPF main menu.
*   MAINMENUHELP2   - Second page of help for the FSPF main menu.
*   EDITLINK        - EFSPF edit Links.
*   EDITLINKHELP1   - First page of help for ESPF Link editing.
*   EDITLINKHELP2   - Second page of help for ESPF Link editing.
*   EDITFRAME       - Edit the Frames.
*   EDITFRAMEHELP1  - First page of help for ESPF Frame editing.
*   EDITFRAMEHELP2  - Second page of help for ESPF Frame editing.
*   EDITPOPUP       - A little popup for requesting information from the user.
*   BRICKSHELP####  - The user enters '?####' and gets this help screen.
*   DEBUGCONSOLE    - Debugging console.

MAPSET FSPF1
MAP MAINMENU SIZE 24x80
  INPUT WELCOMEA  AT 0 ,10  LEN 50  PROT COLOR=BLUE
  INPUT WELCOMEB  AT 1 ,10  LEN 50  PROT COLOR=BLUE

  INPUT FRAMENAME AT 4 ,68  LEN 5   PROT UNDERSCORE COLOR=BLUE
