  FIELD           AT 15,0   LEN 78   PROT COLOR=BLUE          "The first example LINKs the ISPF editor when I is entered."
  FIELD           AT 16,0   LEN 78   PROT COLOR=BLUE          "All of the text for the row is in Cyan / Turquoise."
  FIELD           AT 17,0   LEN 78   PROT COLOR=BLUE          "In Column D the flag 'C' indicates this Link has a value for DFHCOMMAREA."
  
  FIELD           AT 19,0   LEN 78   PROT COLOR=BLUE          "The second example creates a Link that switches to the ADMIN Frame when"
